      "english": "I work in Bangkok.",
      "focus": "place",
      "register": "polite",
      "new_words": ["กรุงเทพ"],
      "tip": "ที่ here means 'at/in'. กรุงเทพ is Bangkok — Thais usually shorten it to กทม. in writing. ที่ is another Phase 4 word doing everyday work.",
