      "english": "Can you speak Thai?",
      "focus": "ability",
      "register": "formal",
      "new_words": ["ภาษาไทย"],
      "tip": "ได้ after a verb = 'can'. พูดได้ = can speak. The pattern is verb + ได้ + ไหม — worth drilling, it unlocks 'can I / can you' for everything.",
